# Everything in this directory is uploaded to the docker daemon as the build
# context. Deny by default, so a file dropped in here -- a token, a .env, an
# editor backup -- cannot reach the image just by sitting next to the Dockerfile.
#
# Note that `COPY scripts/ /usr/local/bin/` installs whatever it is given as an
# executable, so the scripts are listed individually rather than by directory.
# A new script has to be added here too, or it will not be in the image.
*

!claude-user-settings.json
!mise.toml
!scripts/post-start-devcontainer
!scripts/post-start-claude
!scripts/post-start-github
